1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:12,180
How to install the Talented app on your phone

2
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:21,500
Open the price list on your phone and tap "Pasang Aplikasi Talented" at the top.

3
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:32,180
Android: in Chrome, open the three-dot menu and choose "Install app" or "Add to Home screen".

4
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:43,300
Option not showing? Make sure the page has fully loaded over HTTPS, then try again.

5
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:54,560
iPhone or iPad: open the page in Safari and tap Share (the box with an up arrow).

6
00:00:55,160 --> 00:01:03,010
Then choose "Add to Home Screen". Scroll the Share menu if you can't see it.

7
00:01:03,610 --> 00:01:13,310
Keep the name "Talented" and tap Add. If available, turn on "Open as Web App".

8
00:01:13,910 --> 00:01:26,780
Done! The Talented icon is now on your home screen. Free, no Play Store or App Store needed.

9
00:01:27,380 --> 00:01:41,780
Free consultation: linktr.ee/talentededucationgroup. All prices are estimates; final amounts follow the school's offer letter.
